OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers through the morning. Showers
OL,7,Ftending to fade through the afternoon,
OL,8,Fthough a few continuing across the
OL,9,Fnorthwest. Winds lighter than
OL,10,FWednesday. Feeling cooler than of late
OL,11,Fbut pleasant in the sunnier moments.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continuing across the
OL,14,Fnorthwest of the UK, with longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain spreading eastwards
OL,16,Facross northern Scotland. Dry
OL,17,Felsewhere, with lengthy clear skies. A
OL,18,Frather chilly night to come.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
