OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and sunny day for much
OL,6,Fand England and Wales. Cloudier skies
OL,7,Facross Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fat times, with further rain across
OL,9,Fnorthwest Scotland. Warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
